    "fiat_on_ramps": "Telos has fewer direct integrations with institutional fiat-to-crypto payment gateways (e.g., MoonPay, Transak, Ramp Network) compared to larger networks.",
    "developer_ecosystem": "While technically superior in latency and MEV prevention, the network has a smaller developer and merchant base than dominant payment ecosystems like Solana or Base."
  },
  "verdict": "Telos is technically superior to many networks for high-frequency, micro-payment, or point-of-sale applications requiring sub-second finality, MEV prevention, and near-zero, non-volatile fees. However, builders must account for lower native stablecoin liquidity and fewer pre-integrated fiat payment gateways relative to incumbents like Solana, Tron, and Polygon."
